msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……そうだ……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CA3F6677_C063_4924_BF31_AA028A2DFDB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a6dcddcec15248361d3debc83afb238cdffd16f8278a7206fa38cb99a8cf3db
