#: scenario7:scenario7_6FC2541E_7EDE_4AA8_A380_23647591A82B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8111e4cf3cbc14b1fbc21b72bb42526ba29b7a9f7b363d4de8325fe06ee8d1f2
