#: scenario7:scenario7_EBF8C076_5FC9_4BA2_A55A_73FC3D5FB75E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a6b0844c57b829ff1f789ca02b1e1edf4b091c485cdbd28a43a5c2fdf8d26a8
#. default-sha256: df58cf0fd669deb4a7a77af02ff0b63cfebb5b2b256eaeee1da1f30ffdd93dd3
