#: scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cef5f961f669b538947a24c05d9877f0bd672fda302a1648cba765f4330a2dca
#. default-sha256: 7d6b890b385150ed80880eab5c7c0cbae37262bcb028f2e099b981c3c17d7b81
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Allow me to make a prediction before I depart, Michel,⟪k:3⟫cursed namesake of an "
"archangel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ねえ、⟪k:3⟫ミシェル……天使の名を持つ呪われた人。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫最後に予言をさせてくださ"
"い。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9432002E_3B4C_4E54_A621_26ABC935A699
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bb50064ba40fe5bccb41faea3b6a18a0a39bbd3429c7a72ecc0d1467553d5d9
#. default-sha256: 56cd6f3de6005571d137a032de5ad0c55d02a71ff999d4746506c92519d05044
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9432002E_3B4C_4E54_A621_26ABC935A699"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You may think that you’re making some sort of “progress,”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but the fact of the "
"matter is, you’ve gone nowhere."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたは今、⟪k:1⟫あなたなりに一歩を踏み出したつもりかもしれない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫けれど、⟪k:4⟫現実"
"は何も変わっていないのです。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9B8B8197_CE62_4D65_87FC_E0E45E54C0B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9b1b424ce5a756187f29cc2c533e8d1b3b5120e2f7160386811fef1517c9d3e
