#: scenario7:scenario7_DB086719_3AA8_4B4D_9D36_A56526C367CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17cad2fcc987f12a0834b707c6b4df799a3c0623a9db3e90b0453b0be9a1c765
