#: scenario7:scenario7_529F6EBD_96C8_4123_A776_ED2C8823E58E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74e9cca7071b644ade049ec4566f2157e7d3e5dff480d88d88db925c8ffcdde5
