#: scenario7:scenario7_C82A27E0_D8BD_4232_9550_E317F7852BDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd0438c8abde110f7cbccecb09efd9b4f85e9196365e5d595946f4744f452b1b
