msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had started to develop a great affection for that smile,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だというのに、⟪k:1⟫一度喜びを覚えると――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女の笑顔を愛しく思い始めると――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2747A89C_B0C5_479B_A101_973064899AC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5af6b296bd1a7f66116a4cbd3c840b36ca291e95157d620b50932b93be5462f
