"⟪k:0⟫and as much as I tried to tell myself I was just getting caught up in the moment, that the "
"feelings would pass in time,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どれほど、⟪k:1⟫一時の気の迷いであると、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ただの衝動であると言い聞かせても……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7149B57B_E55C_4294_B15B_BC6789FB8CA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0ee32f01da6ab68e766c6c08a22d003109ae1b7e04977d641606c87cf6b841b
