#: scenario7:scenario7_263DB46F_49D6_48D8_BD5C_7DD6FBECF526
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50779fe29e5b777d6bb48fd501118a19e706326b7a01f1245dfd3543eadb1fac
