msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FF73576A_7E96_4468_B183_07FA2C041689"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I thought that if we were simply friends,⟪k:1⟫I would still be able to see that smile,⟪k:2⟫"
"even if you were to learn what I was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫友人のままでいれば、⟪k:1⟫もしも私の真相を彼女が知ったとしても――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫笑ったままでいてくれ"
"るかもしれない。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B491D2E7_200D_4D0B_95E7_AF6152B2F895
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be71cf7a2a8d304cb440acfea365c3ae1cac24c61cabf1e0300bf14a1e100664
