msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫so much to ask?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……許されないことだったのだろうか……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F0404CDD_03FA_4CF4_81E2_D47BF4139C4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6945865d513dd72ed13be42aed607d0803a15961e82e3f38a5b89e3fa306a6c1
#. default-sha256: a0c53f3ead90139083438acbcadde9153973b613ccb548b7a26c0c4ce6fc41ea
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F0404CDD_03FA_4CF4_81E2_D47BF4139C4C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Things began to change when I learned my father Antonin had passed away. ⟪k:2⟫Georges "
"would, I assumed, be busy preparing to take his place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫父アントナンの病死を知り、⟪k:2⟫私の状況は変わり始めた。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫今頃は次兄ジョルジュが"
"相続に追われていることだろう。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BA2072B3_AA3A_4A8C_BF7C_DE5FC60E3BDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8ec5d6df52d375b1e332a82ac27631d1015f4c0cf970e06f89f6c917cbe2123
#. default-sha256: 9e64551c520fb323f20c41b513eb15e6339eb7394be8b4054cee636564bfb86d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BA2072B3_AA3A_4A8C_BF7C_DE5FC60E3BDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And if what he had said was true...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫then I would be welcomed back to the estate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そしてジョルジュの言葉が本当であるならば……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫私は、⟪k:3⟫あの家の子供として再び認められ"
"るのだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E6879ABC_FE9A_4732_91F3_9C03BD666832
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 037d8bd85e2b798e980c505b8ac40b43dfeefade3e7192990cce126ef85c4d9a
