msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E6879ABC_FE9A_4732_91F3_9C03BD666832"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would no longer be a demon child...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but a member of the Bollinger family once "
"more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫悪魔の子ではなく……、⟪k:1⟫家族のひとりとして……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C540D85F_DC39_43DC_BBBE_871388586DF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0dc15656aedb0cacd9f650a1fad5a58450a72344edcb43817af3526dcb4b0c26
#. default-sha256: 9290949b5e222c830f8e43b4e6d7f9644949ad9d8d37f502adaf7e2849d2d712
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C540D85F_DC39_43DC_BBBE_871388586DF8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Deep down, though, I couldn’t completely believe it would actually happen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫どうしても――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それが実現するのだと、⟪k:4⟫心から信じることが出来なかっ"
"た。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_076527FC_5F37_4AC6_B601_036991180DF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcd95de2f0b9ddda5843560d8c6d71c5ddafe15381172f44937b53e10b86d1f4
#. default-sha256: cc1de8677085a56cf0224be15f894eca9e0f5a5a951fdfa96f8d630f18de8b58
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_076527FC_5F37_4AC6_B601_036991180DF9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After eleven years in exile, I had no idea how they felt about me anymore. ⟪k:1⟫Would they "
"even remember a promise they had made so long ago?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫長い幽閉の果てに、⟪k:1⟫彼らが今どのように思っているかなど、⟪k:2⟫分からない。⟪k:3⟫十一年前の約"
"束を彼らが覚えているのかどうか――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3C8143EA_71F5_45CF_B20E_2F960C89A27E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1df149b44640b40d22a8d088b4a65883b21cab0ef41c18f720bca1500653e777
#. default-sha256: 88b9a58dd8af295b1f2eed2d562dbb0a875480fdc951c7a4aae167c37b921979
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3C8143EA_71F5_45CF_B20E_2F960C89A27E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fear that they wouldn’t threatened to consume me,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それを考えれば、⟪k:1⟫不安が私を蝕んでいった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6560BC1B_A205_4FEE_80C5_A138926A580E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 940bed7c7386d0f2c9657c2ee700eb025b432f7c27f98be76c5fe22da2751d4d
#. default-sha256: b1e8d78542d6e1e1f89f6b2072939c8f7085366ed08503b564e204bb955b686b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6560BC1B_A205_4FEE_80C5_A138926A580E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but Giselle, as she often seemed to do, put my mind at ease."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫私の不安を拭い去ってくれるのは、⟪k:2⟫やはり彼女だった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A9339E9E_EE0C_4CCA_9808_28431CA84F94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 876657a29a57c34a46281d9b5fe2205b8f3b4ec5d3ee655339243240daa22c45
#. default-sha256: d79a6455f1563802214535ba11299b3d0b99dd0b57a2dff20536adb3e697f747
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A9339E9E_EE0C_4CCA_9808_28431CA84F94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No matter where I go, you’ll be there with me, Michel.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s true, I ⟪k:3⟫am⟪k:4⟫ "
"nervous not knowing what the future holds,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫だって、⟪k:1⟫どんなところに行くとしてもミシェルが一緒でしょう？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫たしかに今は、⟪k:4⟫"
"先が分からなくて不安だけど――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_43D6CB3D_C24F_4DED_A176_6F51CC818569
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56cfa76c75f625f59006c4fe57b055fae8f8aa8ebe11b7be698be85e8729afdf
#. default-sha256: e1c218777cc6744ec81fa10c2f3e28f12240a310a276a8d1c70fb20ed752855b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_43D6CB3D_C24F_4DED_A176_6F51CC818569"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but not in a “scared something bad might happen” kind of way.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s more of a "
"jittery, excited anxiousness..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その不安は、⟪k:1⟫決して、⟪k:2⟫恐ろしいものではないんです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫輝かしい未来を期待するよ"
"うな、⟪k:5⟫そんな気持ちもあって……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0EE74A7_6EA4_4546_9DD9_0D307985388A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5dba295f6fb21f6dd554ce1680092df1ac8e7e09c1392b2590db6f4a6e2f4d14
#. default-sha256: b19a2a0a13b0cbbdf8896d68e9976aa9c75051973c7d2a6cea897e4e5adf3dba
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0EE74A7_6EA4_4546_9DD9_0D307985388A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m confident the two of us can overcome anything,⟪k:1⟫no matter what obstacles may come our "
"way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫きっと――、⟪k:1⟫二人一緒でなら、⟪k:2⟫なんでも乗り越えられると思うんです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫何があった"
"としても……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DA5E7A12_BC06_4FBA_96DE_24F23007CFCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b8af2ead39136fae1308c0798a0d8fff222073d69ad474bec86336ec7d4954a
#. default-sha256: b0d1c1159b01589e566e624a9fbf2354d81259b989fa75464ef8911c0cbd4285
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DA5E7A12_BC06_4FBA_96DE_24F23007CFCC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Together, we can create an even more wonderful future."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫二人一緒に――、⟪k:1⟫今以上のすばらしい未来を作っていけるわ……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B621E089_C9DB_4020_AC1B_D020E5ECC2A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 331d6edc5e3c3817a1fda71fd497ab405378b5bbc0bb8a92935207bdced76789
