msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_52B4A47F_3FBC_46FE_8889_8D228C2B78CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89265e3044176070e168d77853c1ddbc7d76f3d8959e03f3274dbd2303a08b55
#. default-sha256: faa66b3a58afb3fef19ab9e446ef589172c8853f722ef7a8024badc1746981d6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_52B4A47F_3FBC_46FE_8889_8D228C2B78CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Could I believe her?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Could I have faith in her “wonderful future”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ジゼル、⟪k:1⟫それを――私も信じていいのだろうか。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私たちにすばらしい未来が存在するのだ"
"と……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8496AAD8_89FB_4C87_965E_1C504B5CA648
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2894c60d84104fd572bd38a80ac80bac627a3284662eff53e647ea897c611ade
#. default-sha256: dc6ecf151e46fed4eca3b72a95ddaefc30688a8d9624fcedc8b903c9c44563a1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8496AAD8_89FB_4C87_965E_1C504B5CA648"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That she would always be there with me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That we would return to the estate and "
"finally move on with our lives?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫これから先も、⟪k:1⟫君と共に過ごしていけるのだと……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あの家に戻り、⟪k:4⟫ようやく人生を"
"歩めるのだと……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CFCBB848_D3A6_4B89_9B0E_0F4D011F7F9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aca5c8113e9855074b6c614249a02cbe347fb73cc827c99de99712dd44448e86
#. default-sha256: 5cd0e10a1b3965bf6821ef39817ba3106373df55a7f81bccf843b088a4942155
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CFCBB848_D3A6_4B89_9B0E_0F4D011F7F9E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That together, we could create a future?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫二人でなら未来を作れるのだと……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FF7A9A11_CC8D_48C8_B37C_CE38AD346560
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bed992eee3f48ae281e1593e2e6579bd52cec6a1a61ee5751264220bb8ba216
#. default-sha256: b5fdef00ee35e9909b95c0f55f6171b3938a7cf070511085fcb4796367fefe50
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FF7A9A11_CC8D_48C8_B37C_CE38AD346560"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫that wasn’t a question.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I ⟪k:4⟫wanted⟪k:5⟫ to have faith."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……いや、⟪k:1⟫私は……、⟪k:2⟫それを――信じたい。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FA751393_5799_421A_B114_9645FBCD6460
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bed10b59c4e65848cc562defeb820367ecf839239e86137b655ad5212178331
#. default-sha256: 55eafe98136fb2f5e3d3e5869a36954273439963f5c16b9653e4489d40e050e3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FA751393_5799_421A_B114_9645FBCD6460"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted to believe as much as she did."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私も……、⟪k:1⟫信じたいんだ……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AE70EE43_1C7D_4836_A37A_B8A5D836484A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6da7c6f9da1361d6590497541bfd2af3ed02eee1d907cce27ae658d2517e4b5a
#. default-sha256: c5001f48a78f33ddb01bab843d29fe7e21441c57fe6bc18c3d4614f54c920140
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AE70EE43_1C7D_4836_A37A_B8A5D836484A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanted to believe that, even if I was gray,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I could have a normal life together "
"with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫たとえ、⟪k:1⟫私が灰色の人間であっても――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫君と共に、⟪k:4⟫普通の人間が送るような人生を"
"得てみたい。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F1EE43E6_1C10_4575_9712_103942992DFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 345be636c0d1205cf59299ee98e81169e69538636da85f0f850919463f4e50b0
#. default-sha256: 583ba0a4aa343d5e057b545319b8a633a3448caa026880c4b74fa4dce2c5bb85
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F1EE43E6_1C10_4575_9712_103942992DFE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had rescued me from the depths of Hell,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私を地獄から救い出してくれた君を――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9F07AB5C_30B4_475A_A8F6_0E6D8BF77487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b5bec6474083ba72c7b94f85fb9fe116b9b2fb1f96da1fea54334dca3bfd920
#. default-sha256: 1f3e50a3cf2fa1176bbd3b0741105a7814ab0a80875b6990de516d997893fb15
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9F07AB5C_30B4_475A_A8F6_0E6D8BF77487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and now, I wanted to make her happy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今度は、⟪k:1⟫私が……⟪k:2⟫幸せにしてあげたい……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_64F6898E_57EF_4289_BFB5_B222403F0EF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb1588b61bddc7eda91b077294b6fd978e9453526d40961956d4ee0b6a6d0c8b
#. default-sha256: 223170ba0cb1ea5c3f454c7553dcb6c71bf7ed01147f5164fcfca41a3b09e03b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_64F6898E_57EF_4289_BFB5_B222403F0EF6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫After taking that step in our "
"relationship, I made numerous attempts to reveal the truth about what I was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫ジゼルとの関係が変わってから、⟪k:11⟫何度も"
"自分の真実を告げようと思った。⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫けれどその度に、⟪k:14⟫私の心臓は強く痛み――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6C6872B9_9964_4589_9AAB_E2986C07D629
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96c34c4df1b17c7d3e5f7735fbb871fe97116967fb6e123d2fd17778d3c8d5ac
#. default-sha256: 88533bdf6c1785679781f3fe377866c8f4db456b62a7207118b8e97fdabf855c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6C6872B9_9964_4589_9AAB_E2986C07D629"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But every time I tried, sharp pain gripped my chest, and my words faded into nothing before "
"they could reach my lips."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫出そうと思っていた言葉を、⟪k:1⟫失わせてしまう。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_12788F89_8B5C_45F9_B9CC_4B68C9BE3FA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d947f097e481a9dad9a1ece6f7fe2a170721fedbd9d87120852e5a0fb7dbb18
#. default-sha256: 1aa873df4405a3f097582de6f353e78045e43470f9b78c2c8b7e4e5f49492dba
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_12788F89_8B5C_45F9_B9CC_4B68C9BE3FA7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew that if our relationship were to continue, I would have to tell her eventually, but "
"merely imagining her face twisted in disgust nearly crushed me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫この関係を続けるのならば、⟪k:1⟫打ち明けなければならないと分かっていたが、⟪k:2⟫受け入れられな"
"かった瞬間のことを思うと押しつぶされそうになる。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8C92BBC9_A4DD_4D1A_9458_5BAC3C1B788E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de9452ddd662513b4c9a53436689e74ff565d6e613344a67f0161820e9347ce4
